    "report_md": "## Incident Summary\n\nA high-severity alert was triggered on `workstation5` involving a malicious PowerShell invocation and scheduled task creation. \n\nAn encoded PowerShell process executed `schtasks.exe` to create a daily scheduled task named `MordorSchtask` set to run at 09:00 (`E040898`). The task executes a hidden PowerShell command that decodes a Base64 payload retrieving content from the registry (`HKCU:\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion`). This behavior is indicative of persistence and defense evasion using living-off-the-land binaries.\n\n## Verdict\n* **Verdict:** True Positive\n* **Severity:** High\n* **Techniques:** T1053.005 (Scheduled Task), T1059.001 (PowerShell), T1027 (Obfuscated Files or Information)"
  },
